    "Description": "Letter to Dr. H.R. Chamblee, Jr. from Durward R. Center on September 14, 1977. Paper has a letterhead that reads: \"Historical Instrument Restorations, 2100 St. Paul Street, Baltimore, Maryland 21218 (301)752-4771.\" The letter includes a price estimate and details/requirements for Mr. Center to restore the Wurlitzer Style 125 band organ for the Pullen Park Carousel. Signed by Mr. Center at the bottom. Written in the bottom left in blue ink is a cc'd list of three people, including Mrs. Cy Farley. ",
